{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","x":-180,"y":-134,"width":360,"height":268,"text":"# Transformer 实战与大模型微调 · 重点 5\n\n学习目标: 覆盖 Transformer 实战、大模型演进、开源模型和参数高效微调\n\n回忆: 能否从 Transformer 原理讲到训练、推理、大模型演进和 PEFT 微调","color":"6"},
		{"id":"core","type":"text","x":-640,"y":-2296,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**核心原理** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 位置编码、缩放点积注意力和多头注意力如何协作"},
		{"id":"data","type":"text","x":320,"y":-2640,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**数据与输入管线** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 从原始文本到动态 batch 的完整数据流"},
		{"id":"impl","type":"text","x":320,"y":-896,"width":320,"height":180,"text":"**Transformer 实战模块** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Embedding、Attention、Block、Encoder/Decoder 如何搭起来"},
		{"id":"train","type":"text","x":320,"y":892,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练与推理** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: mask、损失、warmup、翻译和 BLEU 如何串起来"},
		{"id":"llm","type":"text","x":-640,"y":-68,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**大模型演进** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 预训练、SFT、GPT/BERT/ChatGPT 的核心变化"},
		{"id":"open","type":"text","x":-640,"y":2149,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**开源模型与长上下文** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: LLaMA、ChatGLM、RoPE/YaRN、GQA/MoE 解决什么问题"},
		{"id":"peft","type":"text","x":320,"y":2504,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**参数高效微调** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 为什么全量 SFT 成本高，PEFT 如何降低成本"},
		{"id":"core-pos","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-3220,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**位置编码** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 绝对位置编码如何给 Token 注入顺序信息"},
		{"id":"core-sdpa","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-2758,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**缩放点积注意力** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: QK^T、缩放、Softmax、加权 V 的计算顺序是什么"},
		{"id":"core-mha","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-2142,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**多头注意力** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 为什么要拆成多个 Head，最后如何合并"},
		{"id":"core-norm","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1680,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**LayerNorm** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Transformer 为什么更偏向 LayerNorm 而不是 BatchNorm"},
		{"id":"core-res","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-1352,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**残差连接**"},
		{"id":"core-scale","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2923,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**为什么除以 sqrt(d_k)** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 维度增大时点积方差如何变化，缩放有什么作用"},
		{"id":"core-dot","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2584,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**为什么使用点积**"},
		{"id":"core-split","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-2276,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**拆分多头**"},
		{"id":"core-merge","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-1968,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**合并与 W_O**"},
		{"id":"data-moses","type":"text","x":800,"y":-3236,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Moses 分词**"},
		{"id":"data-bpe","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2948,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Subword / BPE** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: BPE 如何缓解未登录词并控制词表大小"},
		{"id":"data-dataset","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2620,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Dataset**"},
		{"id":"data-tokenizer","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2332,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Tokenizer** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: encode 和 decode 分别在数据流中做什么"},
		{"id":"data-loader","type":"text","x":800,"y":-2024,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**DataLoader** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 动态 batch 如何提高 GPU 利用率"},
		{"id":"impl-embed","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1655,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**TransformerEmbedding** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Token Embedding 与位置编码如何相加"},
		{"id":"impl-mha","type":"text","x":800,"y":-1193,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**MultiheadAttention** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Q/K/V 投影、拆头、mask、Softmax、合并的完整流程"},
		{"id":"impl-block","type":"text","x":800,"y":-720,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**TransformerBlock** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Block 内自注意力、交叉注意力和 FFN 的顺序"},
		{"id":"impl-stack","type":"text","x":800,"y":-423,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**Encoder / Decoder 堆叠** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 多层 Encoder/Decoder 如何循环更新表示"},
		{"id":"impl-mask","type":"text","x":800,"y":-104,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**Mask 生成** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: Padding Mask 与 Look-ahead Mask 分别在哪里使用"},
		{"id":"impl-wqkv","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1316,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**Wq / Wk / Wv**"},
		{"id":"impl-wo","type":"text","x":1280,"y":-1008,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**W_O 输出映射**"},
		{"id":"train-loss","type":"text","x":800,"y":265,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**CrossEntropyWithPadding** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 如何忽略 PAD 位置并正确计算翻译损失"},
		{"id":"train-warmup","type":"text","x":800,"y":595,"width":320,"height":114,"text":"**Warmup** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 学习率为什么要先升后降"},
		{"id":"train-loop","type":"text","x":800,"y":892,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**训练循环** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 前向、损失、反向、更新的顺序是什么"},
		{"id":"train-infer","type":"text","x":800,"y":1200,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**翻译推理** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 从原始文本到最终译文的完整推理链路"},
		{"id":"train-bleu","type":"text","x":800,"y":1528,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**BLEU**"},
		{"id":"llm-pretrain","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-992,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**预训练 + SFT** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 预训练和 SFT 分别学习什么、消耗什么"},
		{"id":"llm-arch","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-695,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**三种架构** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Encoder-only、Decoder-only、Encoder-Decoder 的输入输出和典型模型"},
		{"id":"llm-gpt","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":-68,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**GPT 系列** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: GPT-1 到 ChatGPT 的训练目标和能力如何演进"},
		{"id":"llm-bert","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":548,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**BERT** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: Masked Language Model 与句子级表示如何训练"},
		{"id":"llm-chatgpt","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":856,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**ChatGPT 与涌现** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: 为什么规模扩大后会出现上下文学习和通用任务能力"},
		{"id":"llm-gpt1","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-356,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**GPT-1**"},
		{"id":"llm-gpt2","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":-48,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**GPT-2**"},
		{"id":"llm-gpt3","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":260,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**GPT-3**"},
		{"id":"open-llama","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":1544,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**LLaMA 系列** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: LLaMA 1/2/3 的结构与训练技术如何演进"},
		{"id":"open-chatglm","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":2180,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**ChatGLM**"},
		{"id":"open-rope","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":2468,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**RoPE / YaRN** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: RoPE 如何表达相对位置，YaRN 如何扩展上下文长度"},
		{"id":"open-gqa","type":"text","x":-1120,"y":2776,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**GQA / MoE** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: GQA 和 MoE 分别从注意力与参数利用角度优化什么"},
		{"id":"open-llama1","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1256,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**LLaMA 1**"},
		{"id":"open-llama2","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1564,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**LLaMA 2 / GQA**"},
		{"id":"open-llama3","type":"text","x":-1600,"y":1872,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**LLaMA 3 / MoE**"},
		{"id":"peft-cost","type":"text","x":800,"y":1822,"width":320,"height":268,"text":"**全量 SFT 的成本** · 重点 5\n\n回忆: 全量微调的显存、步数、时间和能力破坏风险分别是什么\n\n条件：数十亿参数全部训练\n影响：显存高、训练久、试错成本大，少量数据可能破坏预训练能力\n替代：PEFT、LoRA、Adapter 等参数高效方法"},
		{"id":"peft-benefit","type":"text","x":800,"y":2196,"width":320,"height":136,"text":"**PEFT 的价值** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: PEFT 为什么能同时降低训练成本并保留预训练能力"},
		{"id":"peft-bert","type":"text","x":800,"y":2524,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**BERT 基座结构**"},
		{"id":"peft-sst2","type":"text","x":800,"y":2832,"width":320,"height":96,"text":"**SST-2 数据**"},
		{"id":"peft-cls","type":"text","x":800,"y":3109,"width":320,"height":158,"text":"**为什么取 last_hidden_state[0]** · 重点 4\n\n回忆: CLS 表示为什么适合句子级分类"}
	],
